# Protected paths (space.yaml `protected:`, rules.md section 8). Pull requests touching
# these wait for the space owner's one click; everything else lands on green.
# `onboard` replaces @OWNER-LOGIN with the owner's GitHub login and keeps this list in
# step with space.yaml. The template repository itself lands every pull request on
# green (docs/decisions.md), so there this file only documents the instance rule.

/identity/      @OWNER-LOGIN
/rules.md       @OWNER-LOGIN
/space.yaml     @OWNER-LOGIN
/.claude/       @OWNER-LOGIN
/_meta/tools/   @OWNER-LOGIN
/.github/       @OWNER-LOGIN
